        "EXPERIMENTAL \u2014 no changes to product workflows.\nBase model, 30 steps, RES multistep, Simple. No Turbo.\nThe guide is fixed conditioning. The sampler gets a NEW empty AV latent.\nCanvas comes from the state. Keep VAE identifiers consistent.\nOptional pictures/audio can be connected to Ref2VA. Number only references actually supplied; the latent guide is not a <Picture 1> token.\nSet the loader to a root/continuation sidecar. Select tail_5 or tail_22. Audio reuse is explicit.\nSave Take outputs the new clip + full raw latent sidecar. Continue using the sidecar.\nTo export, unmute Assemble Takes and paste root + child sidecar paths in order. It encodes original clips once."
